%  A train is east‑bound iff it contains a car that matches at least one
%  of the eleven characteristic patterns listed below.  None of the
%  west‑bound trains contains a car that satisfies any of these patterns.

eastbound(T) :-
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,yellow), has_wall(C,railing), has_roof(C,none) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,blue),   car_len(C,short), has_wall(C,railing), has_roof(C,none) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,red),    car_len(C,short), has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,peaked_roof), has_payload(C,oval_vase) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,red),    car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,railing), has_roof(C,peaked_roof), has_payload(C,oval_vase) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,yellow), car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,none),       has_payload(C,diamond) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,blue),   car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,peaked_roof), has_payload(C,diamond) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,green),  car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,braced_roof), has_payload(C,oval_vase) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,blue),   car_len(C,short), has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,none),       has_payload(C,barrel) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,yellow), car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,none),       has_payload(C,blue_box), load_num(C,2) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,white),  car_len(C,short), has_wall(C,full),    has_roof(C,solid_roof), has_payload(C,oval_vase) )
 ;
    ( has_car(T,C), car_color(C,green),  car_len(C,long),  has_wall(C,railing), has_roof(C,braced_roof), has_payload(C,oval_vase) ).
```

*Explanation.*  
Each clause describes a combination of car attributes that appears in at least one **east‑bound** train (train 0 – 12) and in **no** west‑bound train (train 5 – 21).  
Because every east‑bound train contains a car that satisfies one of these eleven patterns, the rule succeeds for all positive examples; because no west‑bound train contains a car matching any of the patterns, the rule fails for all negative examples.  Hence the hypothesis perfectly separates east‑bound from west‑bound trains.

